### 1. Lance Stripe CLI dans un second terminal :
###  powershellstripe listen --forward-to localhost:8080/api/webhooks/stripe
### 2. Lance l'application :

### 3. Dans Postman, ouvre la connexion SSE :
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/stream
Authorization: Bearer <ton_access_token>
### 4. Initie un transfert dans un autre onglet Postman :
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer <ton_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "beneficiaryId": 1,
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_card_visa",
  "idempotencyKey": "test-uuid-001"
}
### resultat :
event: TRANSFER_INITIATED
data: {"id":1,"message":"Transfert TXN-20250609-0001 initié...","type":"TRANSFER_INITIATED",...}

event: PAYMENT_CONFIRMED
data: {"id":2,"message":"Paiement confirmé...","type":"PAYMENT_CONFIRMED",...}

event: TRANSFER_COMPLETED
data: {"id":3,"message":"Transfert TXN-20250609-0001 complété !...","type":"TRANSFER_COMPLETED",...}